#: ../../source/docs/ros-vio-tracking-camera.rst:146
#: 7ff6d54511e24481a3f69731381d2fa6
msgid "The version of ``realsense-ros`` needs to match with the version of ``librealsense``, so every time you update ros/lib, the other should be updated as well."
